abstract: >-
  An open research program on LLM-controlled agents in strategic games,
  including externally anchored registrations, event-sourced execution,
  mechanical adjudication, behavioral drift monitoring, zero-call replay,
  and public post-adjudication sensitivity analyses.
keywords:
  - behavioral game theory
  - large language models
  - LLM social simulation
  - synthetic participants
  - persona prompting
  - preregistration
  - computational reproducibility
  - mechanical adjudication
  - causal validation

